---
// §6 — "Here's How We're Different" — Mentors / Size / Campus (fixed copy, no fake stats)
---

<section class="w-full bg-white py-[clamp(3rem,8vw,6rem)]" aria-labelledby="different-heading">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-[var(--ysa-max)] px-[clamp(1rem,4.44vw,4rem)]">
		<header class="mb-12 text-center">
			<p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#EDE9FE] px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.06em] text-[#7C3AED] uppercase">
				Why Families Choose YSA
			</p>
			<h2 id="different-heading" class="m-0 text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,2.75rem)] font-bold leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#0F172A]">
				Here's How We're Different.
			</h2>
			<p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-[42rem] text-base leading-[1.65] text-[#64748B]">
				Young Scholars Academy is an accredited virtual learning community built specifically for kids whose brains work differently. Not built for everyone and then adapted. Built for them. From scratch.
			</p>
		</header>

		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 lg:grid-cols-3">
			<!-- The Mentors -->
			<article class="rounded-2xl border border-[#E2E8F0] bg-white p-8 shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(15,23,42,0.04),0_10px_26px_-20px_rgba(15,23,42,0.2)] transition-[border-color,box-shadow] duration-200 hover:border-[#CBD5E1] hover:shadow-[0_12px_34px_-26px_rgba(15,23,42,0.28)]">
				<div class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-[0.75rem] bg-[linear-gradient(145deg,#F5F3FF,#EDE9FE)]" aria-hidden="true">
					<svg class="block size-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
						<path d="M12 2C8.7 2 6 4.7 6 8C6 10.4 7.4 12.5 9.4 13.6C6.1 14.8 4 17.7 4 21H20C20 17.7 17.9 14.8 14.6 13.6C16.6 12.5 18 10.4 18 8C18 4.7 15.3 2 12 2Z" fill="#7C3AED"/>
					</svg>
				</div>
				<h3 class="m-0 mt-6 mb-3 text-[1.0625rem] font-semibold leading-[1.3] tracking-[-0.015em] text-[#0F172A]">
					1. The Mentors.
				</h3>
				<p class="m-0 text-[0.9375rem] leading-[1.65] text-[#475569]">
					Our mentors are obsessed with your kids. They message each other after class about breakthroughs. They meet weekly to talk about how each student is doing. They think about your child at night.
				</p>
				<p class="m-0 mt-4 text-[0.9375rem] leading-[1.65] text-[#475569]">
					Every mentor at YSA is neurodivergent or deeply experienced with neurodivergent learners. Many are parents of gifted or 2e kids. Some homeschool their own children. They don't read about these kids in textbooks. <strong class="font-semibold text-[#0F172A]">They were these kids.</strong>
				</p>
				<div class="mt-6 h-px bg-[#EEF2F7]"></div>
				<div class="mt-6 flex items-start gap-[0.65rem]">
					<span class="mt-[0.1rem] flex size-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center" aria-hidden="true">
						<svg class="block size-4" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M8 1C4.1 1 1 4.1 1 8C1 11.9 4.1 15 8 15C11.9 15 15 11.9 15 8C15 4.1 11.9 1 8 1ZM6.8 11.3L3.7 8.2L4.8 7.1L6.8 9.1L11.2 4.7L12.3 5.8L6.8 11.3Z" fill="#048C3C"/></svg>
					</span>
					<strong class="text-sm font-medium leading-[1.45] text-[#0F172A]">Your child will know the difference in the first five minutes.</strong>
				</div>
			</article>

			<!-- The Size -->
			<article class="rounded-2xl border border-[#E2E8F0] bg-white p-8 shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(15,23,42,0.04),0_10px_26px_-20px_rgba(15,23,42,0.2)] transition-[border-color,box-shadow] duration-200 hover:border-[#CBD5E1] hover:shadow-[0_12px_34px_-26px_rgba(15,23,42,0.28)]">
				<div class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-[0.75rem] bg-[linear-gradient(145deg,#FEFCE8,#FEF9C3)]" aria-hidden="true">
					<svg class="block size-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
						<path d="M16 11C17.66 11 18.99 9.66 18.99 8C18.99 6.34 17.66 5 16 5C14.34 5 13 6.34 13 8C13 9.66 14.34 11 16 11ZM8 11C9.66 11 10.99 9.66 10.99 8C10.99 6.34 9.66 5 8 5C6.34 5 5 6.34 5 8C5 9.66 6.34 11 8 11ZM8 13C5.67 13 1 14.17 1 16.5V19H15V16.5C15 14.17 10.33 13 8 13ZM16 13C15.71 13 15.38 13.02 15.03 13.05C16.19 13.89 17 15.02 17 16.5V19H23V16.5C23 14.17 18.33 13 16 13Z" fill="#D97706"/>
					</svg>
				</div>
				<h3 class="m-0 mt-6 mb-3 text-[1.0625rem] font-semibold leading-[1.3] tracking-[-0.015em] text-[#0F172A]">
					2. The Size.
				</h3>
				<p class="m-0 text-[0.9375rem] leading-[1.65] text-[#475569]">
					6 to 8 students per class. Maximum. No exceptions.
				</p>
				<p class="m-0 mt-4 text-[0.9375rem] leading-[1.65] text-[#475569]">
					Your child isn't performing for a room of 30. They're part of a conversation. They're called on by name and by interest. The mentor knows what they're working on, what lights them up, and what they're struggling with.
				</p>
				<p class="m-0 mt-4 text-[0.9375rem] leading-[1.65] text-[#475569]">
					This is what "personalized education" actually looks like when someone means it.
				</p>
				<div class="mt-6 h-px bg-[#EEF2F7]"></div>
				<div class="mt-6 flex items-start gap-[0.65rem]">
					<span class="mt-[0.1rem] flex size-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center" aria-hidden="true">
						<svg class="block size-4" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M8 1C4.1 1 1 4.1 1 8C1 11.9 4.1 15 8 15C11.9 15 15 11.9 15 8C15 4.1 11.9 1 8 1ZM6.8 11.3L3.7 8.2L4.8 7.1L6.8 9.1L11.2 4.7L12.3 5.8L6.8 11.3Z" fill="#048C3C"/></svg>
					</span>
					<strong class="text-sm font-medium leading-[1.45] text-[#0F172A]">Small cohorts create lasting friendships with true peers</strong>
				</div>
			</article>

			<!-- The Campus -->
			<article class="rounded-2xl border border-[#E2E8F0] bg-white p-8 shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(15,23,42,0.04),0_10px_26px_-20px_rgba(15,23,42,0.2)] transition-[border-color,box-shadow] duration-200 hover:border-[#CBD5E1] hover:shadow-[0_12px_34px_-26px_rgba(15,23,42,0.28)]">
				<div class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-[0.75rem] bg-[linear-gradient(145deg,#E0F2FE,#BAE6FD)]" aria-hidden="true">
					<svg class="block size-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
						<path d="M10 20V14H14V20H19V12H22L12 3L2 12H5V20H10Z" fill="#0EA5E9"/>
					</svg>
				</div>
				<h3 class="m-0 mt-6 mb-3 text-[1.0625rem] font-semibold leading-[1.3] tracking-[-0.015em] text-[#0F172A]">
					3. The Campus.
				</h3>
				<p class="m-0 text-[0.9375rem] leading-[1.65] text-[#475569]">
					Classes happen on Zoom. But that's not the whole story.
				</p>
				<p class="m-0 mt-4 text-[0.9375rem] leading-[1.65] text-[#475569]">
					Between sessions, students log into a virtual campus. They walk between buildings as avatars. They sit with friends in common areas. They eat lunch together. They build a social life that extends beyond any single class.
				</p>
				<p class="m-0 mt-4 text-[0.9375rem] leading-[1.65] text-[#475569]">
					Cameras are always optional. The campus opens daily, 7 AM to 7 PM Pacific. <strong class="font-semibold text-[#0F172A]">It's a place they want to be... not a meeting they endure.</strong>
				</p>
				<div class="mt-6 h-px bg-[#EEF2F7]"></div>
				<div class="mt-6 flex items-start gap-[0.65rem]">
					<span class="mt-[0.1rem] flex size-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center" aria-hidden="true">
						<svg class="block size-4" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M8 1C4.1 1 1 4.1 1 8C1 11.9 4.1 15 8 15C11.9 15 15 11.9 15 8C15 4.1 11.9 1 8 1ZM6.8 11.3L3.7 8.2L4.8 7.1L6.8 9.1L11.2 4.7L12.3 5.8L6.8 11.3Z" fill="#048C3C"/></svg>
					</span>
					<strong class="text-sm font-medium leading-[1.45] text-[#0F172A]">For kids burned by screen fatigue, this changes everything</strong>
				</div>
			</article>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
